     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Lymph Nodes: no overlying erythema, lymphangitic streaking, visual edema, visual enlargement. Nodes are soft, freely mobile, and discrete with no enlargement, warmth, and tenderness in the occipital, pre/post auricular, retro-pharyngeal, parotid, submandibular, submental, anterior/posterior cervical, supraclavicular, infraclavicular, epitrochlear, inguinal, femoral, popliteal lymph nodes."
     }
